.TH "arena" "3" "2026\-10\-07" "arena" "Arena Manuals"
.SH NAME
\fBarena\fR \- single\-header library.\&
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBarena\fR is a library with smart memory arena.\& Arena
can allocate and free memory once.\&
.PP
There're list of functions:
.PP
\fBInitArena\fR
.RS 4
Initial function for \fBArena\fR.\&
.RE
.PP
\fBArenaReset\fR
.RS 4
Reset all data in arena.\&
.RE
.PP
\fBArenaAlloc\fR
.RS 4
Allocate bytes in arena.\&
.RE
.PP
\fBArenaFree\fR
.RS 4
Free arena.\&
.RE
.PP
